<title>UK: BayerVB sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets warrants on Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank AG said it has issued five million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom AG.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	19.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, MUNICH   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>	  CALL 1     CALL 2    CALL 3    PUT 4    PUT 5</p>
<p> STRIKE 33.0 DEM   34.50 DEM 36.0 DEM  27.0 DEM 28.50 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
